{"id":"vod_bf_37456","vodId":"37456","provider":"bf","providerName":"暴风资源","type":2,"name":"无能的奈奈","name_cn":"无能的奈奈","date":"2020-01-01","year":"2020","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"已完结","images":{"common":"https://img.bfzypic.com/upload/vod/20230424-38/d3c887e4ba187ba90fc3778d9705ba19.jpg"},"summary":"故事发生在一座位于孤岛之上的学校里，在这里学习的，都是身怀绝技的超能力者。这些孩子们被告知，在不久后的将来，即将发生灾厄，为了能够应对来袭的“人类之敌”，他们必须在这与世隔绝的孤岛上接受生存训练。　　外表可爱，拥有读心术的柊奈奈（大久保瑠美 配音）、无论受了怎样的伤害都能够自愈的小野寺京谷（中村悠一 配音）、可以令时间停止的涩泽阳平（增田俊树 配音）、拥有治愈他人外伤能力的犬饲满（中原麻衣 配音）、能令其他的超能力者的能力失效的中岛七男（下野纮 配音），当学校里开始出现死亡事件之时，这些孩子们能否使用他们的能力彼此保护呢？","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-04-29 22:51:28","playable":true,"episodeCount":13,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"bfzym3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf3.com/video/wunengdenainai/第01集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf3.com/video/wunengdenainai/第02集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf3.com/video/wunengdenainai/第03集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf3.com/video/wunengdenainai/第04集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf3.com/video/wunengdenainai/第05集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf3.com/video/wunengdenainai/第06集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf3.com/video/wunengdenainai/第07集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf3.com/video/wunengdenainai/第08集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf3.com/video/wunengdenainai/第09集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf3.com/video/wunengdenainai/第10集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf3.com/video/wunengdenainai/第11集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf3.com/video/wunengdenainai/第12集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf3.com/video/wunengdenainai/第13集/index.m3u8"}]}],"snapshotAt":"2026-10-22T09:30:41.459Z"}